{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00857","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 战城南 · 李白","name":"鼓吹曲辞 战城南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年战桑乾源，今年战葱河道。\n洗兵条支海上波，放马天山雪中草。\n万里长征战，三军尽衰老。\n匈奴以杀戮爲耕作，古来唯见白骨黄沙田。\n秦家筑城备胡处，汉家还有烽火然。\n烽火然不息，征战无已时。\n野战格鬬死，败马号鸣向天悲。\n乌鸢啄人肠，衔飞上挂枯树枝。\n士卒涂草莽，将军空尔爲。\n乃知兵者是凶器，圣人不得已而用之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}